                </p>
                <div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant">
                    © 2026 MarketConnect - Chợ Việt Online. All rights reserved.
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-span-1">
                <h4 class="font-label-md text-label-md font-bold mb-4 text-on-surface">Về MarketConnect</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-3 font-body-md text-body-md">
                    <li><a class="text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-opacity opacity-80 hover:opacity-100" href="/Stores">Gian Hàng Chợ</a></li>
                    <li><a class="text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-opacity opacity-80 hover:opacity-100" href="/MobileVendors/CallMap">Gọi Hàng Rong</a></li>
